        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/adam/{size}/1946_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-28T02:09:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Interest, probably not, but there is upkeep, and that’s not cheap either. Think how expensive it is just to keep someone on a breather, then imagine that breather is a multimillion-dollar mobile cryogenic containment system combined with a painstakingly calibrated climate-control chamber, and all the power requirements of both.</p>",
